MENU TITLE 1T Lumina on Orange Pi 5 Ultra
TIMEOUT 30
DEFAULT lumina

LABEL lumina
    MENU LABEL 1T Lumina (@KERNEL@)
    LINUX /boot/Image-@KERNEL@
    INITRD /boot/initramfs-@KERNEL@.img
    FDT /boot/lumina/rk3588-orangepi-5-ultra-@KERNEL@.dtb
    APPEND root=@ROOT@ rw rootwait console=ttyS2,1500000n8 console=tty1 consoleblank=0 loglevel=4 lsm=lockdown,yama,integrity,selinux
